        "description": "EEG showing focal epileptiform discharges corresponding to lesion location",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Histopathological confirmation or characteristic MRI findings combined with clinical focal epilepsy",
    "notes": "Definitive diagnosis often requires histopathological examination post-surgical resection."
